 "cfg": 1, "sampler_name": "euler", "scheduler": "simple", "start_at_step": 0, "end_at_step": 8, "return_with_leftover_noise": "disable"}}, {"id": 29, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "pos": [619.6627688413553, 823.52978515625], "size": [310, 130], "flags": {}, "order": 5, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "宽度", "name": "width", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "width"}, "link": 465}, {"localized_name": "高度", "name": "height", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "height"}, "link": 466}, {"localized_name": "批量大小", "name": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "Latent", "name": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "links": [184]}], "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.61", "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "widgets_values": [864, 1248, 1], "widgets_values_named": {"width": 864, "height": 1248, "batch_size": 1}, "color": "#322", "bgcolor": "#533"}, {"id": 90, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "pos": [1131.0868716245584, 130], "size": [568.4045736507657, 648.8738038919435], "flags": {}, "order": 6, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "clip", "name": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "link": 453}, {"localized_name": "文本", "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "widget": {"name": "text"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "条件", "name": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "links": [441, 462]}], "title": "正向提示词", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.62", "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "widgets_values": ["她站在便利店玻璃门前，手里握着一瓶草莓牛奶，像是刚从深夜便利店里走出来，被等在门外的朋友随手拍下了这一幕。\n\n全身入镜，浅景深压缩了背景。\n\n一张清纯的小圆脸，眼神怯怯的，像是不好意思被朋友拍到。黑色长发被夜风撩得微微散开，是一位刚满十八岁的中国女孩，未施粉黛的脸上还带着少女特有的稚气与羞涩。\n\n浅粉色修身针织衫紧紧贴着上身曲线，外面随意披了件白色短款外套，袖子挽到手肘；下身是一条浅蓝色高腰牛仔短裤，把腰线拉到最显腿长的位置；脚踩白色运动鞋，双腿纤细修长，在便利店的灯光下泛着柔润的光。\n\n深夜的便利店门前，玻璃门上印着红色发光的\"便利店\"和白色发光的\"24H OPEN\"字样，表面蒙着一层细微的水雾。背景是便利店明亮温暖的灯光，脚下的白色瓷砖地面光滑如镜，反射着斑驳的霓虹光影。\n\n街拍人像，超写实画质。"], "widgets_values_named": {"text": "她站在便利店玻璃门前，手里握着一瓶草莓牛奶，像是刚从深夜便利店里走出来，被等在门外的朋友随手拍下了这一幕。\n\n全身入镜，浅景深压缩了背景。\n\n一张清纯的小圆脸，眼神怯怯的，像是不好意思被朋友拍到。黑色长发被夜风撩得微微散开，是一位刚满十八岁的中国女孩，未施粉黛的脸上还带着少女特有的稚气与羞涩。\n\n浅粉色修身针织衫紧紧贴着上身曲线，外面随意披了件白色短款外套，袖子挽到手肘；下身是一条浅蓝色高腰牛仔短裤，把腰线拉到最显腿长的位置；脚踩白色运动鞋，双腿纤细修长，在便利店的灯光下泛着柔润的光。\n\n深夜的便利店门前，玻璃门上印着红色发光的\"便利店\"和白色发光的\"24H OPEN\"字样，表面蒙着一层细微的水雾。背景是便利店明亮温暖的灯光，脚下的白色瓷砖地面光滑如镜，反射着斑驳的霓虹光影。\n\n街拍人像，超写实画质。"}, "color": "#232", "bgcolor": "#353"}, {"id": 168, "type": "Lora Loader (LoraManager)", "pos": [619.6627688413553, 130], "size": [225, 397.99997678765214], "flags": {}, "order": 4, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "model", "name": "model", "type": "MODEL", "link": 450}, {"localized_name": "text", "name": "text", "type": "AUTOCOMPLETE_TEXT_LORAS", "widget": {"name": "text"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "loras", "name": "loras", "type": "LORAS", "widget": {"name": "loras"}, "link": null}, {"name": "clip", "shape": 7, "type": "CLIP", "link": 452}, {"name": "lora_stack", "shape": 7, "type": "LORA_STACK", "link": null}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "模型", "name": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "links": [464]}, {"localized_name": "CLIP", "name": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "links": [453]}, {"localized_name": "trigger_words", "name": "trigger_words", "type": "STRING", "links": []}, {"localized_name": "loaded_loras", "name": "loaded_loras", "type": "STRING", "links": null}], "properties": {"aux_id": "willmiao/ComfyUI-Lora-Manager", "ver": "392c157cb531805888d4d5054db58dd38ac721ee", "Node name for S&R": "Lora Loader (LoraManager)", "cnr_id": "comfyui-lora-manager", "__lm_widget_ids": ["__lm_autocomplete_meta_text", "text", "loras"]}, "widgets_values": [{"version": 1, "textWidgetName": "text"}, "", []], "widgets_values_named": {"__lm_autocomplete_meta_text": {"version": 1, "textWidgetName": "text"}, "text": "", "loras": []}}, {"id": 106, "type": "SaveImage", "pos": [2808.720247854815, 130], "size": [393.3962083069025, 647.731185513515], "flags": {}, "order": 10, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "图片", "name": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "link": 459}, {"localized_